<title>NETHERLANDS: ING'S SUPERVISORY DIRECTOR DIES.</title>
<headline>ING'S SUPERVISORY DIRECTOR DIES.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial services group Internationale Nederlanden Groep NV (ING) said on Monday that its chairman of the board of supervisory directors Johan Erbe had died at the age of 69.</p>
<p>Erbe, member of the board since 1989, became chairman of the board in May 1996.</p>
<p>ING said it had not yet decided on who would succeed Erbe.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
